gpui-kit 0.8.1
Upstream: https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
License: Apache-2.0, as GPUI Kit's other crates, which carry its LICENSE-APACHE.

Newport modifies gpui-kit for key event constructors for GPUI's added key
fields in its test helpers, choices tracked by value and the search panel's
first keystroke. The changed files are src/test.rs, src/test/events.rs,
tests/integration/input/editor.rs, tests/integration/menu.rs and
tests/integration/search.rs. All other published package files remain
unchanged.
